research/audit/wave3-topology.provenance.jsonl:23:{"id":"rem-connectedness-conventions","statement":"ai-altered","proof":"not-applicable","evidence":"semantic-source","urls":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Connected_space","https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/004R"],"rationale":"The sources expose the competing empty-space conventions and the standard distinctions among separated sets, connectedness, path-connectedness and local connectedness. The remark is a library-specific compilation of those established conventions and scope choices. Both URLs were retrieved through the model-side web route (HTTP 200).","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-04"}
